  # **PLAN**

* 用**完整且可編譯**的版本覆寫 `Terrain/Data/TerrainModification.cs`（原檔被省略成「…」導致成員缺失）。

* `TerrainModification`：提供 `Position/Radius/Value/Type/Timestamp` 與 `TerrainType`（enum）＋ `TerrainTypeValue`（int 背板）並可 set。

* 擴充 `TerrainModificationType`：補 `Flatten/Dig/Fill/Ramp/Tunnel` 等舊呼叫點需要的成員，同時保留原有 `TypeChange/HeightChange/Combined`。

* 修 `TerrainModificationService` 幾個**int ←→ enum** 的不相容賦值，以及 `Timestamp` 的型別一致性（一律 `DateTime`）。

* 清掉仍可能殘留、造成衝突的檔案（重複的 creep 擴充、實驗性的 spatial bounds 擴充、誤加的 `TerrainChunk.partial.cs`）。

  # **CHANGES**

  ## **1\) 覆寫：TerrainModification（完整本體）**

WRITE\_CHANGE: Assets/DeepAbyssHive/Terrain/Data/TerrainModification.cs  
 \<\<\<csharp  
 using System;  
 using UnityEngine;

namespace DeepAbyssHive.Terrain.Data  
 {  
 using DeepAbyssHive.Terrain.Enums;

`/// <summary>`  
`/// Canonical data struct for terrain edits. This replaces the redacted/ellipsis version.`  
`/// </summary>`  
`public struct TerrainModification`  
`{`  
    `// Core`  
    `public Vector3 Position;`  
    `public float   Radius;   // area of effect`  
    `public float   Value;    // strength/intensity`  
    `public TerrainModificationType Type;`

    `// Timing`  
    `public DateTime Timestamp;`

    `// Terrain type bridge (enum <-> int)`  
    `public int TerrainTypeValue; // raw int for legacy sites that expect int`  
    `public TerrainType TerrainType`  
    `{`  
        `get => (TerrainType)TerrainTypeValue;`  
        `set => TerrainTypeValue = (int)value;`  
    `}`  
`}`

`/// <summary>`  
`/// Expanded ops to match legacy call sites.`  
`/// </summary>`  
`public enum TerrainModificationType`  
`{`  
    `// Original minimal set (keep for compatibility)`  
    `TypeChange   = 0,`  
    `HeightChange = 1,`  
    `Combined     = 2,`

    `// Extended set used by services`  
    `Flatten = 10,`  
    `Dig     = 11,`  
    `Fill    = 12,`  
    `Ramp    = 13,`  
    `Tunnel  = 14`  
`}`

}

